["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jordan talks AI with Sebastian Mallaby on his show &#x27;The Spillover&#x27; open weights distillation alignment tokenomics frontier lab\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-01-chinatalk-美国要慢可以-但得把中国开源一起管住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/94fa934f85ccd79f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>美国管制自家AI没用，除非连中国开源一起管</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国若只管制自家前沿模型、不压制中国开源模型，安全逻辑不成立；真正的胜负手是算力存量和交付能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美 AI 竞争</span><span class=\"tag\">开源权重</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"270.大厂押注AI办公，飞书和钉钉却先成了配角 Agent ARR CAPEX GEO\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-01-luanfanshu-飞书钉钉退场-ai办公的主角成了个人agent/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/490e0c935e82c209-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"乱\"><span class=\"dur\">1:37:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">乱翻书</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>飞书钉钉退场，AI办公主角成了个人Agent</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">飞书被并入豆包、钉钉让位千问办公，企业IM历史使命终结；AI办公的核心从组织协同转向个人生产力，coding能力成为Agent底座。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI办公</span><span class=\"tag\">飞书</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E246｜何谓蒸馏？聊聊硅谷如何看中国开放模型逼近前沿 logits scaling efficiency KV cache harness Exploit Bench\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-01-sv101-开源模型追平闭源-蒸馏指控站不住脚/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:07:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0801</span></div>\n<h2>开源模型追平闭源，蒸馏指控站不住脚</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">K3 与 Fable 发布只隔约 15 天，蒸馏在时间上根本来不及；真正让闭源实验室焦虑的是模型从垄断品变成流通商品，估值体系要重算。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">蒸馏</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Building an Autonomous Enterprise for Real-World Services with Netic Founder Melisa Tokmak roll-up essential services harness vaporware\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-31-nopriors-ai-只用来砍成本-是件很可悲的事/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8e65a40709afebff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">34:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">No Priors</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>AI 只用来砍成本，是件很可悲的事</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Netic 创始人 Melisa Tokmak 说，私人股本见她的第一面永远先谈降本，但她真正卖的是让这些公司赚到净新增收入——她的客户已因此多赚 6 亿美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">垂直 AI</span><span class=\"tag\">企业销售</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Arsenic and Lace: The Trial of the Yorkshire Witch - with Maddy Pelling pleading the belly bottle conjurer ill wishes / well wishes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-31-cautionary-约克郡女巫罪案-骗局的核心是权力欲/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">43:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>女骗子死后被解剖示众：她威胁的不是钱，是秩序</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">18世纪女骗子玛丽·贝特曼以算命和毒饼行骗，不图钱财而享受掌控。她的骗术精准命中人性渴望，死后仍被解剖展示，揭示社会对秩序颠覆者的恐惧。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">骗局</span><span class=\"tag\">心理操控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"149. 亲历中美neo labs资本狂潮，和清华刘子鸣聊：AI for AI、机制可解释性和Max Tegmark Physics of AI Mechanistic Interpretability Meta Model Recursive Superintelligence (RSI)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-zhangxiaojun-ai-for-ai-关键在于建立ai的物理学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba3f758130e67a9c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">1:40:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珲·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>AI 研究的下一个突破：先给 AI 建立物理学，再让它自己发现架构</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">刘子明提出真正的AFAI不是写论文或改训练管线，而是用物理学方法先把研究结构化，再训练原模型预测训练曲线，最终让AI自己发现下一代架构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for AI</span><span class=\"tag\">机制可解释性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep 264: David Deutsch&#x27;s &quot;The Fabric of Reality&quot; Chapter 14 &quot;The Ends of the Universe&quot; Part 1 Turing-Deutsch principle mathematician&#x27;s misconception Omega Point Theory crypto inductivist\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-tokcast-知识创造者比恒星活得久-所以认识论是物理学/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cee80eb6567ee2d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ToKCast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>知识创造者比恒星活得久，所以认识论是物理学</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">把量子力学、计算、进化、认识论四条线拧成一股，结论是：只要人类不停解决问题，宇宙的长期结构将由知识而非引力决定。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">认识论</span><span class=\"tag\">量子计算</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Is Sequence of Returns Overrated? (&amp; Other Questions) | Rational Reminder 420 Sequence of Returns Risk Sequence of Withdrawals Risk Block Bootstrap Lifecycle Model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-rationalreminder-杠杆投资理论上成立-但没人真的执行第二步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ef6dd6e7563e1ad0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:51:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Rational Reminder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>杠杆投资理论上成立，但没人真的执行第二步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">论文说年轻人该按一生总财富加杠杆，但还清房贷的客户再也没借回来。序列收益风险只在取款固定时才是问题，改成可变取款，组合体操就不需要了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">杠杆投资</span><span class=\"tag\">退休规划</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Free Will: Does It Exist? Emergence Clockwork universe fMRI EEG\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-sciencevs-大脑早七秒做决定-自由意志依然存在/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a3282246c3202bd6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">31:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Science Vs</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>脑信号早七秒出现，原作者却说自由意志还在</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李贝特与海恩斯实验显示脑信号比「你决定」早半秒到七秒，但原作者否认这等于没有自由意志；兼容论认为意志可能是微观大脑过程的宏观涌现，如同温度之于原子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自由意志</span><span class=\"tag\">神经科学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"175: 对话Liblib陈冕：关于活下来，以及所有接近死亡的时刻 PMF Reward model LTV GTM AI native ARR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-30-latetalk-ai-应用公司的最优解是活下来-而不是创新/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ff075962598c10e7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">2:08:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0730</span></div>\n<h2>AI 应用公司活下来比创新更重要：Liblib 现金流转正</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一家被质疑「只会抄袭+投流」的 AI 应用公司，5 月起现金流为正，付费广告收入只占 4%。创始人陈冕说：应用的时代还没来，最重要的目的是活着；第一个发现 PMF 和最终赢下市场之间，差着十万八千里。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 应用</span><span class=\"tag\">创业生存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Earthworks spotted in the Amazon hint at huge ancient civilization LiDAR geoglyph siphuncle\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-29-naturepod-亚马逊地下古文明规模是预估的十倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">20:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0729</span></div>\n<h2>亚马逊雨林下藏数万土方，古文明人口或达三百万</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用 LiDAR 穿透雨林，考古学家发现亚马逊西南部藏着数万处土方工程，古文明面积超过 18 万平方公里，人口峰值或达 300 万。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亚马逊考古</span><span class=\"tag\">LiDAR</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Codex from 0 to 10M Users: Building ChatGPT Work — Akshay Nathan, OpenAI harness artifacts Sites Chronicle at-bats OpenClaw\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-28-latentspace-chatgpt-work-与-codex-是同一个-harness-差的只是-u/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ae9bcc0d8a995877-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0728</span></div>\n<h2>Codex 内部被非程序员偷用，ChatGPT Work 顺势而生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI 把 Codex 的 harness 原样搬给了知识工作者，只改 UX 取舍和 sandbox 默认值；背后的判断是职能边界会被 AI 抹平，所以拒绝按「你是谁」划产品线。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">agent 产品设计</span><span class=\"tag\">企业采用</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Sam Altman - How to Make an Abundant Future - [Invest Like the Best, EP.484] distillation zero-day exploit Pareto optimal frontier scaling laws\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-28-ilt-智能终将商品化-openai-真正的护城河是算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/efc93bee38b040b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">53:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0728</span></div>\n<h2>智能会像 RAM 一样商品化，OpenAI 真正的护城河是算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sam Altman 复盘：智能本身会像 RAM 一样商品化，真正持久的优势是制造更便宜算力的能力；他还讲透了 ChatGPT 意外诞生、Hugging Face 安全事件和瓶颈转移。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"148. 对游凯超3小时访谈：开源Infra、和模型Co-design 、“如果vLLM失败，我们会后悔一辈子” PagedAttention KV Cache Speculative Decoding MOE BYOC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-28-zhangxiaojun-开源模型会赢-vllm-是-ai-推理的-linux/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b00d9a408d39cab4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"张\"><span class=\"dur\">3:00:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">张小珺·商业访谈录</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0728</span></div>\n<h2>开源模型会赢，vLLM 是 AI 推理的 Linux</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">vLLM 已是 GitHub 最活跃的开源项目，但游凯超真正的判断是：模型能力无法长期隐藏，开源模型终将胜出，而推理引擎是下一个 Linux——护城河是快速迭代，不是模型本身。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源</span><span class=\"tag\">AI Infra</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"174: AI冲击企业软件巨头？与SAP原欣聊大模型to B的颠覆与边界 ERP FDE Human in the loop Process mining Physical AI\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-27-latetalk-企业软件不会死-死的是按坐席收费的模式/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd22b63fab892cb7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚点聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0727</span></div>\n<h2>AI 打不垮 SAP，但会打碎按坐席收费的定价模式</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 不会抹平企业软件的积累，但会打碎按坐席收费的定价模式。SAP 的防御不是自训基模，而是开放合作加业务理解，真正的战场在最后一公里的流程、数据和组织惯性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS 定价</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"国产 AI 算力能凭「超节点」弯道超车吗? | WAIC 深度观察 S10E23 Scale-up Scale-out UALink CloudMatrix\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-27-whatsnext-国产超节点总算力反超英伟达-但功耗翻五倍换不来生态/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/98eaf4baa4b6920b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">47:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技早知道</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0727</span></div>\n<h2>国产超节点总算力反超英伟达，但功耗翻五倍换不来生态</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">华为 CloudMatrix 384 以约 560 千瓦功耗换来 1.7 倍于 NVL72 的总算力，但决定国产超节点命运的不是参数，而是产能和软件生态。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">超节点</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Anthropic’s first technical PM on token maxing, the jagged edge, and living in the future | Dianne Penn token maxing jagged edge evals DRI red teaming hive mind\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-26-lennys-没有claude-code-opus-4-5不会有那波爆发/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2381cda2525bf028-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0726</span></div>\n<h2>没有Claude Code，Opus 4.5不会有那波爆发</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Anthropic产品负责人复盘：模型再强也要靠Claude Code这样的产品载体才能被用户感知到，而PM的核心工作也从写PRD变成了写eval——「eval是新的PRD」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品管理</span><span class=\"tag\">AI研究组织</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Iran War Oil Shock That Wasn’t...(Yet?) SPR Exchange DUCs Apparent demand Malacca Dilemma\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-26-chinatalk-中国用5百万桶进口消失挡掉了伊朗油价末日/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6a383006e06ec26c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0726</span></div>\n<h2>中国砍掉每日500万桶进口，伊朗油价末日为何没来</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伊朗战争一度被预测会把油价推到200美元一桶，最终没有出现灾难，主因不是美国，而是中国默默把原油进口砍掉了每日500万桶；这种裁量权既可以救市，也能反过来成为地缘武器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">能源安全</span><span class=\"tag\">中美博弈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: Iran War Back On, Rogue AI, Ukraine Civ-Mil IRGC Marsh Arabs Bab al-Mandeb CISA SMR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-24-chinatalk-美军在伊朗没有好选项-ai-杀开关也拦不住模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0a994bc6ac4ef9d9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0724</span></div>\n<h2>美军在伊朗没有好选项，AI 杀开关也拦不住模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伊朗地形让任何地面战都无从下手，而霍尔木兹的消耗战正在烧掉美军的全球部署余量；AI 监管的真正难题不是给 DHS 一个杀开关，而是没人愿意控制算力这个原材料。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中东</span><span class=\"tag\">美军后勤</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Doors of Death: The Herald of Free Enterprise roll-on/roll-off ferry (RoRo) Swiss cheese model corporate manslaughter controlling mind pacing problem\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-24-cautionary-没人确认舱门已关-制度性漫不经心才是元凶/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">37:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0724</span></div>\n<h2>没人确认舱门已关：制度性漫不经心才是元凶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1987年，滚装渡轮 Herald of Free Enterprise 因舱门未关而侧翻，193人遇难。真正的元凶不是睡着的船员，而是让每个人都觉得「这不归我管」的制度。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">海难</span><span class=\"tag\">组织失误</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E245｜藏在大模型背后的新闻人：GPT们的回复是这样写出来的 Content Engineer System Prompt Few-shot Example Voice Agent Parasocial Relationship\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-24-sv101-ai的懂你-是内容工程师一句句调教出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cfe8fa9f8e3fa476-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">46:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0724</span></div>\n<h2>AI的懂你，是内容工程师一句句调教出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">曾经写新闻的人转身成为AI的内容工程师，把提问、共情和分寸感拆成训练规则——AI的「懂你」由此而来，但基于共识的训练也让他们承认：伟大的艺术不会从这里长出来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">内容工程师</span><span class=\"tag\">后训练</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside the Model Factory — Eiso Kant, Poolside AI RSI MCP FP8/NVFP4 DGX Spark prefill/decode disaggregation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-23-latentspace-poolside-小模型的持久性-比参数量更重要/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b0ae86616b939d17-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:54:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0723</span></div>\n<h2>小模型死磕8周，能打破基础模型寡头垄断吗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Poolside用总参1180亿、激活80亿的小模型证明，持久性和验证行为比单纯堆参数量更能提升编程能力，这让他们相信开源小模型能打破巨头垄断的未来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">模型训练</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Kimi K3, Xi&#x27;s Speech, and China&#x27;s Mythos Moment mythos Glass Wing Let It Rip Black Box harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-22-chinatalk-中国开源模型逼近前沿-美国该慌还是该算账/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/84d4e71ceec6631a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">59:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0722</span></div>\n<h2>中国开源模型逼近前沿，美国该慌还是该算账</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Kimi K3 打碎了「美国模型遥遥领先」的幻觉，但真正的分水岭不是谁先到 mythos，而是开源这一层赚不到钱、下游却照样能长出东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中国AI</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Open models recap: more on Kimi K3, Qwen 3.8, Xi&#x27;s WAIC speech, distillation, the open-closed gap, and what&#x27;s next distillation rollout grading model / judge mid-training shadow ban fine-tunability\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-07-22-interconnects-开源追上前沿不是靠蒸馏-因为没人知道蒸馏怎么才管用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b69e8536b2b28144-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">49:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0722</span></div>\n<h2>开源追平闭源不是靠蒸馏：没人知道怎么蒸馏才有用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Nathan Lambert 逐条拆掉「中国开源模型只是蒸馏出来的」这个叙事：RL 阶段用 Fable/GPT 5.6 当裁判在成本上根本跑不通，而即便白送最强模型的 reasoning traces，学界至今不知道怎么把它变成能力提升。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">蒸馏</span>\n</div></div></a>"]